  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoroberio bw’emeremo y’abasikari na ab’emeremo ende",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo noro omooroberio bw’Abaisraeli na abateneneri be chiamate chiabo na obw’abatang’ani b’abasikari chilifu na ab’amagana, na obw’abateneneri b’emeremo ende yonsi ase oborwoti. Kera omotienyi ase omwaka ekeombe ki’abaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000), nigo kiarenge gokora emeremo inse y’oboraai bw’omotang’ani bw’omotienyi oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasobeamu, mosinto o Sabidieli, nere otenenerete ekeombe egetang’ani, ase omotienyi bw’eritang’ani; ekeombe kiaye nigo kiarenge nabaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nigo arenge bw’ororeria rwa Peresi, na orenge omochiki bw’abatang’ani bonsi b’abasikari ase omotienyi bw’eritang’ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dodadi bw’ororeria rw’Ahohi nere otenenerete ekeombe ki’omotienyi o kabere. Ekeombe kiaye nigo kiarenge nabaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000). Mikiloti nere orenge omokonyi oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoteneneri bw’ekeombe kia gatato, ase omotienyi o gatato, nere Benaya, mosinto o Yehoyada Omokuani. Benaya nigo arenge omotang’ani omonene, na ekeombe kiaye nigo kiarenge nabaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya nere orenge omonto etuoni, omanyekanete ase baria Emerongo etato, naende orenge nomochiki obo. Amisabadi, omomura oye, nere orenge komokonya ase ekeombe ekio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo o kane, Asaeli, omomura omwabo Yoabu, akaba omoteneneri bw’ekeombe ki’omotienyi o kane, na Sebadia, omomura oye, akagetenenera magega yaye. Ekeombe kiaye nigo kiarenge nabaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo o gatano, Samuti bw’ororeria rwa Isihari akaba omoteneneri bw’ekeombe ki’omotienyi o gatano. Ekeombe kiaye nigo kiarenge nabaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo o gatano na rimo, Ira, mosinto o Ikesi Omotekoa akaba omoteneneri bw’ekeombe ki’omotienyi o gatano na rimo. Ekeombe kiaye nigo kiarenge nabaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo o gatano na kabere, Helesi, Omopeloni bw’ororeria rw’Efraimu, akaba omoteneneri bw’ekeombe ki’omotienyi o gatano na kabere. Ekeombe kiaye nigo kiarenge nabaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo o gatano na gatato, Sibekai bw’ororeria rwa Husa Omozera akaba omoteneneri bw’ekeombe ki’omotienyi o gatano na gatato. Ekeombe kiaye nigo kiarenge nabaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo o kianda, Abieseri korwa Anatoti bw’ororeria rwa Benjamini akaba omoteneneri bw’ekeombe ki’omotienyi o kianda. Ekeombe kiaye nigo kiarenge nabaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo o ikomi, Maharai korwa Netofa bw’ororeria rwa Zera akaba omoteneneri bw’ekeombe ki’omotienyi o ikomi. Ekeombe kiaye nigo kiarenge nabaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo o ikomi na rimo, Benaya korwa Piratoni bw’ororeria rw’Efraimu akaba omoteneneri bw’ekeombe ki’omotienyi o ikomi na rimo. Ekeombe kiaye nigo kiarenge nabaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo o ikomi na kabere, Helidai korwa Netofa bw’ororeria rw’Otinieli akaba omoteneneri bw’ekeombe ki’omotienyi o ikomi na kabere. Ekeombe kiaye nigo kiarenge nabaanto chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaraai b’ebisaku bi’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nabwo barenge abaraai b’ebisaku bi’Abaisraeli:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliezeri, mosinto o Sikiri, ase Abareubeni;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sefatia, mosinto o Maaka, ase Abasimeoni;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasabia, mosinto o Kemueli, ase Abalawi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zadoki ase abanto ba Aroni;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elihu, oyomo bw’abamura bamwabo Daudi, ase Abayuda;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omuri, mosinto o Mikaeli, ase Abaisakaru;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isimaya, mosinto bw’Obadia, ase Abasabuloni;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yerimoti, mosinto bw’Asirieli, ase Abanafutali;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hosea, mosinto bw’Asasia, ase Abaefraimu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoel, mosinto o Pedaya, ase ekeng’ese kende ki’egesaku kia Manase;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido, mosinto o Zakaria, ase ekeng’ese ki’egesaku kia Manase, keria kiarenge agwo Gileadi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yaasieli, mosinto bw’Abineri ase Ababenjamini;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asareli, mosinto o Yerohamu, ase Abadani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aba nabwo barenge abaraai b’ebisaku bi’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi tabarete na korika abanto konya bataraika emiaka emerongo ebere, ekiagera Omonene nariete eira ng’a namente Abaisraeli babe abange buna ching’enang’eni chia igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu, omomura bw’omokuungu Seruya, agachaaka kobara Abaisraeli, korende takoorete emeremo eyio. Nyasae akaba nendamwamu ase Abaisraeli ase engencho y’okobarwa koria, na omobaro oyio tobegetwe ase Egetabu ki’ogokora gwa Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abateneneri b’enibo y’omorwoti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asimaweti, mosinto bw’Adieli, agatenenera chimonga chi’omorwoti; na Yonathani, mosinto bwa Usia, agatenenera chimonga chi’ense eria, ase emechie emenene na emeke, na ase emerobiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiri, mosinto o Kelubi, agatenenera abakori emeremo b’emegondo, abarenge koyerema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simei Omoramati agatenenera emegondo y’emesabibu, na Sabidi Omosifumi agatenenera edivai ase yare kogachwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baali‐Hanani Omogederi agatenenera emezeituni na emeko agwo ase ense omweya. Na Yoashi agatenenera ebigachero bi’amaguta ’amazeituni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sitirai Omosaroni agatenenera amaicho arenge korisia agwo Saroni, na Safati, mosinto bw’Adilai, agatenenera amaicho arenge korisia ase amakura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obili Omoisumaeli agatenenera chingamia, na Yedaya Omomeroni agatenenera chitigere, na",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasisi Omohagari agatenenera ching’ondi ne chimbori. Aba bonsi nigo barenge abateneneri ba chinibo chia Daudi omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abasemia ba Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathani, ise moke Daudi, nere orenge omosemia; nigo arenge omonto omong’aini naende omonyasemi. Ere na Yehieli, mosinto o Hakimoni, nigo barenge abateneneri b’abana abamura b’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahitofeli nere orenge omosemia bw’omorwoti, na Husai Omoariki nomosani bw’omorwoti orenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada, mosinto o Benaya, na Abiatari bakabeekwa ase ribaga ri’Ahitofeli g akuure. Yoabu nere orenge omochiki bw’abasikari b’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
